tration activities. Prepares various Federal, state and local tax returns. Works on various projects and other duties as assigned. Provides advice and training to other team members. Job Duties Position performs research and provides recommendations on various GASB and tax-related issues. Prepares financial analyses and schedules, assists with year-end closing, financial statement preparation and external audits. Performs various investment administration activities. Prepares various Federal, state and local tax returns. Works on various projects and other duties as assigned. Provides advice and training to other team members. Job Open Date 09/03/2026 Job Close Date Open Until Filled No Position Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Cover Letter Resume Optional Documents 371 Wilson Boulevard, Rochester, MI 48309 248-370-2100     To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
