    "https://jobs.oakland.edu/postings/38722": {
      "title": "GSRP Evaluation Data Collector Position: Washtenaw County",
      "description": "Oakland University Employment Site | GSRP Evaluation Data Collector Position: Washtenaw County Skip to Main Content Employment Opportunities Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Human Resources Benefits Campus Map Student Employment GSRP Evaluation Data Collector Position: Washtenaw County Bookmark this Requisition Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Posting Details Position Title GSRP Evaluation Data Collector Position: Washtenaw County Department 2055 - Human Development & Child Study Position Number E36678 Requisition No. TC06490 Salary Range/Pay Rate $26 per hour Benefits of Working at Oakland University No benefits are associated with this position. Employee Group/Grade Casual Job Category Casual /Temporary Casual/Temp Classification Work Schedule Casual (19hrs or less, No Benefits ) Shift/Days We are seeking applicants available for 2–3 weekday mornings during preschool classroom hours in September–October and April–May to conduct in-person child assessments. Some afternoon and/or evening availability will also be needed to complete required post-assessment paperwork. Pay Schedule Hour Number of Hrs./Wk. 5-7 Position Information Position Information Employee's Effective Start Date 08/24/2026 If this is a Temporary position, provide end date or enter N/A for any other position type. 08/30/2027 Minimum Qualifications ● Experience working with preschool children ● Available to work week-day morning hours ● Must have reliable transportation ● Ability to follow specific, standardized protocols ● Strong organizational skills ● Excellent interpersonal, oral and written communication skills ● Willingness to learn new technology Desired Qualifications ● Familiarity with Michigan’s state-funded Prekindergarten program, Great Start Readiness Program ( GSRP ), and Michigan’s early childhood landscape ● Prior experience conducting child assessments in early childhood classrooms Position Purpose Job Duties Responsibilities include completing a mandatory training to be held in late August (date TBD ), contacting teachers to arrange – mutually-agreed upon times to assess study children in their classrooms, driving to sites in the county of Washtenaw, and additional tasks as assigned. Must pass a background check prior to hiring/starting. Job Open Date 08/13/2026 Job Close Date Open Until Filled No Position Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Cover Letter List of References Resume Optional Documents 371 Wilson Boulevard, Rochester, MI 48309 248-370-2100     To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
